# The pre-0.7 export, removed 2026-09-23. JSONL is not a supported channel
# (ruled 2026-09-13): not sync, not a backstop, not disaster recovery. The
# store is seeds/*.md. Named exactly, NOT *.jsonl — gleaned.jsonl is tracked
# repo state that glean writes, and a blanket pattern would hide it in any
# store where it is not already tracked.
seeds.jsonl
